  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 22-layer planar multilayer thin-film stack on CaF2 (Daimon-20) substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat) (22 coating layers). Optimize all 22 layer thicknesses with bounds set to ±30 nm around these center values: [962, 612, 734, 659, 459, 1168, 384, 593, 862, 479, 484, 1139, 337, 437, 852, 446, 824, 1233, 945, 389, 816, 870] nm. Use gradient_thickness optimizer with reduced learning rate for local refinement. Evaluate transmittance at four wavelength bands: 2500-3100 nm (suppress), 3250-3350 nm (pass), 4200-4300 nm (pass), 4450-5000 nm (suppress). No metal layers. Coherent TMM calculation under frequency-domain plane-wave illumination.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize the 22 layer thicknesses of a ZnS/Al2O3 alternating stack on a CaF2 substrate with air incidence across 2500 to 5000 nm. Minimize transmittance in 2500-3100 nm and 4450-5000 nm bands while maximizing transmittance in 3250-3350 nm and 4200-4300 nm bands. Apply ±30 nm bounds to each center thickness and use a reduced-learning-rate gradient-based optimizer under coherent plane-wave illumination.",
